Odd one out.

00:09:29.783 --> 00:09:30.616
I was just like

00:09:30.616 --> 00:09:32.163
it's a little suspicious.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.570
- I just went with Succubus again

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.250
just 'cause like I don't
think there's anyone else.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.410
(beeping)

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.348
- Wow. I thought we had a sisterhood.

00:09:43.348 --> 00:09:44.580
(laughing)

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:47.580
Honestly, I'm pissed

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.047
but hey, I mean, vote out
your best competition.

00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:51.642
- And then there were four.

00:09:51.642 --> 00:09:53.370
- Oh top four.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.800
- [Director] If you think
the mole is still in the box

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.390
and you wish to continue playing the game,

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:58.540
please raise your hand.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.700
We need a majority vote.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.320
- Who did you think was the mole then?

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.153
I'm just curious.

00:10:08.153 --> 00:10:08.986
- I thought the mole was Samantha.

00:10:08.986 --> 00:10:09.960
- Samantha.
- Yeah.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.563
- Samantha.

00:10:11.563 --> 00:10:12.565
- Samantha.

00:10:12.565 --> 00:10:14.580
- I thought it was
Succubus but I don't know,

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.821
I like having more money.

00:10:15.821 --> 00:10:17.880
I like the idea of more money.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.650
- I don't wanna accuse
you of being the mole.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:20.959
You just have been so quiet

00:10:20.959 --> 00:10:22.230
but I don't,

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.520
I haven't heard much from you.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:24.896
- I mean being the youngest,

00:10:24.896 --> 00:10:29.280
I mean, I'm not used to talking
to drag queens in a sense.

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.270
I don't go out.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.680
I go to school and that's about it.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.790
- Did you say you don't identify

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.310
as a drag artist or a drag
artist but a drag queen?

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:36.840
Like which one would you-
- I identify as a drag queen.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:37.980
- Drag queen. Okay.
- I use it

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.990
because it expresses my femininity

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.780
as a non-binary person
instead of out of drag.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.245
- Yeah. I'm fine splitting
it as four people.

00:10:45.245 --> 00:10:46.710
- I'm okay with that.

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:48.438
Guess I just looked greedy, okay.

00:10:48.438 --> 00:10:49.868
(laughing)

00:10:49.868 --> 00:10:50.792
- A little.

00:10:50.792 --> 00:10:52.110
- [Director] Okay. If the lights turn red,

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:54.932
that means the mole is still
in the box and you lose.

00:10:54.932 --> 00:10:56.526
If the lights turn green

00:10:56.526 --> 00:10:59.043
that means the mole is out and you win.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:00.893
Ready?

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.075
(suspenseful music)

00:11:05.075 --> 00:11:07.701
(cheering)

00:11:07.701 --> 00:11:08.630
- Money!

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:10.080
Money!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.230
- I'm so sorry.
- No, I get it.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.063
- We did it.

00:11:13.063 --> 00:11:14.430
We're winners, baby.
- I know.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.300
- Top four.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.560
- [Director] So on the count of three

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.417
will the mole please reveal themselves.

00:11:19.417 --> 00:11:20.570
One...

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.065
- Two, three.

00:11:24.065 --> 00:11:25.873
(clapping)

00:11:25.873 --> 00:11:28.048
- I shouldn't have said I was at Rocco's.

00:11:28.048 --> 00:11:30.570
I was like I need to
think of a bar right now.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:31.440
I need to think of a bar

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.910
and I need to think of a show.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:33.743
I'm like (groans).

00:11:33.743 --> 00:11:35.240
- You said at Rocco's and I said,

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.450
uh-uh, not in West Hollywood.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:37.860
- Right.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:41.351
- So I am actually a full-time
influencer and makeup artist.

00:11:41.351 --> 00:11:45.600
So I thankfully do have a
lot of drag queen friends.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.860
Laganja is actually a really close

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.114
friend of mine.
- Not anymore.

00:11:48.114 --> 00:11:49.301
- No, no.

00:11:49.301 --> 00:11:51.007
This is actually is Gia Gunn's outfit.

00:11:51.007 --> 00:11:52.155
- Oh.

00:11:52.155 --> 00:11:52.988
- This is Gia's.

00:11:52.988 --> 00:11:54.360
- The beauty.
- The glamor.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.770
- [Director] What are you
leaving here today with?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.920
- Well, not cash

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:00.324
but I am leaving here with
a thought that holy crap,

00:12:00.324 --> 00:12:02.700
I really can do anything, honestly.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.760
- I like to say the only
requirement to do drag

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.450
is a desire to be fabulous.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.970
- Drag also for me has taught me so much

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:12.420
about my gender and when
Sugar shared different parts

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.700
about their identity, I
just could see how drag

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:15.990
was helping transform them.

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:18.453
And I did feel a connection
and just saw the authenticity.

00:12:18.453 --> 00:12:20.460
- And I hope other people can see

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.335
that there are more than one kind of drag,

00:12:22.335 --> 00:12:25.023
more than one type of person can do drag.

00:12:27.104 --> 00:12:28.635
- Yes!

00:12:28.635 --> 00:12:31.218
(upbeat music)

00:12:33.264 --> 00:12:35.347
(cheers)

00:12:37.132 --> 00:12:38.132
- We did it!

